  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_017 (multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, avgpool, weighted) achieves 0.7062 accuracy at low cost. This experiment tests replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation (config_025) while keeping other components the same, which could capture more complex interactions between modalities. Transformer aggregation is a key design choice with uncertain impact on accuracy, and this test balances exploration of promising components (imagenet_vit_l) with exploitation of existing success. Expected cost is higher than config_017 (~8-10 GPU hours) but justified by potential accuracy gains."
